{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13225130","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13225130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322513001:1":{"text":"말할게요! 전부 다 말할 테니까 죽이지만 말아주세요!","source_cn":"我招！我全都招！只要别杀我，我什么都愿意交代！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD06AED8B7C120FD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322513002:1":{"text":"흥, 속일 생각은 하지 말라고요! 훔친 물건이 고작 이 정도일 리가 없잖아요. 나머지 물건을 어디에 숨겼는지 솔직히 말하세요!","source_cn":"哼，别想耍花样！你们偷到的东西肯定不止这么一点，老实说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAFA34FBAF3A8D94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322513003:1":{"text":"말할게요, 말할게요... 전부 남쪽에 있는 나무 아래에 숨겼어요...","source_cn":"我说，我说……我们都……都藏在树下了……就是南边的那棵树……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BA5D1DF5BB1684C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:吓破胆的盗匪":{"text":"겁에 질린 도적","source":"吓破胆的盗匪","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}